    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a captivating top-down adventure with <i>Virago: Twisted Reality</i>, the latest installment in the Virago series. Step into the shoes of Willow, a brave little girl navigating a mysterious and perilous world. Explore a vast open world and uncover hidden secrets, all while evading a relentless stalker.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-Down Exploration:</strong> Experience the world from a new perspective, reminiscent of beloved classics like <i>Stardew Valley</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Adventure:</strong> Roam freely across diverse landscapes filled with challenges, puzzles, and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Escapes:</strong> Stay one step ahead of a menacing stalker as you unravel the story and fight for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Storytelling:</strong> Immerse yourself in a gripping narrative that blends the innocence of childhood with the intensity of suspense.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a captivating top-down adventure with <i>Virago: Twisted Reality</i>, the latest installment in the Virago series. Step into the shoes of Willow, a brave little girl navigating a mysterious and perilous world. Explore a vast open world and uncover hidden secrets, all while evading a relentless stalker.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-Down Exploration:</strong> Experience the world from a new perspective, reminiscent of beloved classics like <i>Stardew Valley</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Adventure:</strong> Roam freely across diverse landscapes filled with challenges, puzzles, and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Escapes:</strong> Stay one step ahead of a menacing stalker as you unravel the story and fight for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Storytelling:</strong> Immerse yourself in a gripping narrative that blends the innocence of childhood with the intensity of suspense.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Virago: Twisted Reality is a top-down adventure where you guide Willow through an open world filled with mysteries and tense escapes.",
